# Testimony of Life (Q218), a second class-change testimony for elves, played by a level 38
# Elven Knight wearing a Talin's Spear of its own (only a spear in hand slays the Unicorn of
# Eva for its tears), every script roll pinned to 0: Cardien starts it and pays the level 37
# set's Dimensional Diamonds (102 for an elf, once per character); Hierarch Asterios gives
# his letter and the Moonflower Charm; Thalia sends the traveller to Pushkin, who wants ten
# pure mithril ores, twenty wyrm talons and twenty ant soldier acids for the Pure Mithril Cup;
# Arkenia's contract asks Adonius for twenty spider ichors and harpy downs; Arkenia's
# stardust and Thalia's second letter send the traveller to Isael, who wants the six pieces
# of Talin's spear of the Leto Lizardman Shamans; Thalia's Grail of Purity brings the tears of
# the unicorn, Thalia the Water of Life, Asterios the Camomile Charm, and Cardien the Mark of
# Life; then relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q218_testimony_of_life.golden
character Lively 38
class 19
equip 3026
random always 0
script quest.Q218_TestimonyOfLife
item 3026 3140 3141 3142 3143 3144 3145 3146 3147 3148 3149 3150 3151 3152 3153 3154 3155 3156 3157 3158 3159 3160 3161 3162 3163 3164 3165 3166 3167 3168 3169 3170 3171 7562
page villagemaster/30154.htm
page trainer/30300.htm
page default/30371.htm
page trainer/30375.htm
page default/30419.htm
page trainer/30460.htm
page default/30655.htm
page script/quest/Q218_TestimonyOfLife/
npc cardien 30460 Trainer 10 0 0
npc asterios 30154 VillageMasterPriest -10 0 0
npc thalia 30371 Folk 0 10 0
npc pushkin 30300 Trainer 0 -10 0
npc arkenia 30419 Folk 20 20 0
npc adonius 30375 Trainer -20 20 0
npc isael 30655 Folk 20 -20 0
npc basilisk 20550 Monster 40 0 0
npc wyrm 20176 Monster -40 0 0
npc ant 20082 Monster 0 40 0
npc spider 20233 Monster 0 -40 0
npc harpy 20145 Monster 40 40 0
npc shaman 20581 Monster -40 40 0
npc unicorn 27077 Monster 40 -40 0


# Cardien: an elf of the first occupation at level 37 or more may start; the first testimony
# of the set pays the diamonds, which turns the accept page into 30460-04a.htm.
action cardien
action cardien
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=cardien item=0 page=trainer/30460.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{cardien}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=cardien item=0 page=script/quest/Q218_TestimonyOfLife/30460-03.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
bypass Quest Q218_TestimonyOfLife 30460-04.htm
